{"text": "From now on, whenever I make a grammar mistake in Spanish, correct me immediately instead of waiting until the end.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "language-learning-practice", "hard": false, "why": "Standing instruction governing future replies", "source": "kimi-k3:language-learning-practice:2029"}
