{"text": "From now on, address me as \"Sie\" in German, not \"du\" — I need the practice.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "language-learning-practice", "hard": false, "why": "Standing form of address rule", "source": "kimi-k3:language-learning-practice:2029"}
